          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "This prequel to the game known in the West as Crash'n the Boys: Street Challenge sees Kunio-kun competing in four not-so-traditional athletic events.\n\nThe game was originally released as Downtown Nekketsu Koushinkyoku: Soreyuke Daiundoukai, but has since been localized as Downtown Nekketsu March Super-Awesome Field Day!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Esta precuela del juego conocido en Occidente como Crash'n the Boys: Street Challenge muestra a Kunio-kun compitiendo en cuatro pruebas atléticas poco convencionales.\n\nEl juego se lanzó originalmente como Downtown Nekketsu Koushinkyoku: Soreyuke Daiundoukai, pero después se localizó como Downtown Nekketsu March Super-Awesome Field Day!",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
