    {
      "id": 4437,
      "nameEs": "Surprise! Nekketsu New Records! The Distant Gold Medal",
      "originalName": "Surprise! Nekketsu New Records! The Distant Gold Medal",
      "year": 1992,
      "igdbId": 48341,
      "popularity": 0,
      "iconic": false,
      "fields": [
        {
          "field": "best_version",
          "value": "9841",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "name_es",
          "value": "Surprise! Nekketsu New Records! The Distant Gold Medal",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Surprise! Nekketsu New Records! The Distant Gold Medal",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Toudou Mamoru's plan that tried to crush the other schools in the athletic meet, ended in failure. While his team played decent, he underestimated the strength of Nekketsu High. Toudou doesn't take the loss lightly, and goes back to the drawing board in his quest for complete domination.\n\nWith his wealth and influence, Kounosuke Todou is set on making things right and announces another event! Fight back, Kunio-Kun!\n\nThe game was originally released as Bikkuri Nekketsu Shin Kiroku! Harukanaru Kin Medal, but has since been localized as Surprise! Nekketsu New Records! The Distant Gold Medal.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "El plan de Toudou Mamoru, que intentaba aplastar a las demás escuelas en el torneo atlético, terminó en fracaso. Aunque su equipo jugó bien, subestimó la fuerza del instituto Nekketsu. Toudou no encaja bien la derrota y vuelve a la mesa de dibujo en su búsqueda de un dominio absoluto.\n\nCon su riqueza e influencia, Kounosuke Todou está decidido a enmendar las cosas y anuncia otro evento. ¡Contraataca, Kunio-kun!\n\nEl juego se lanzó originalmente como Bikkuri Nekketsu Shin Kiroku! Harukanaru Kin Medal, pero después se localizó como Surprise! Nekketsu New Records! The Distant Gold Medal.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1992",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
